    emotionKey: 2
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 4
    displayTexts:
    - 'You stare at the broken glass chamber behind you. A smile appears on your
      face. "This has given me so many chances to better myself. Increase my value,
      my utility. I hope this time, I produce enough value for them." The voice in
      your head says. You have no definitive idea of the message behind it, but still
      you feel compelled to recite a prayer of gratefulness to it. '
